{"id":"n72399-1-7","stage":4,"title":"일제히 · 一齐","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72399-1-7-1","ko":"오늘따라 학생들이 많네요. 일찍 마쳤나 봐요.","zh":"今天学生真多啊，看来他们早就放学了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"학생들이","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생들이","audio":"/audio/df0a3ceff6a63deb8792.mp3"}},{"text":"많네요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많네요","audio":"/audio/5479912738bb2f404d05.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"마쳤나","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마쳤나","audio":"/audio/23d45f1a9122c3d5c13e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f510feada73501862675.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72399-1-7-2","ko":"오늘부터 초등학교가 일제히 겨울 방학에 들어가서 그래요.","zh":"因为从今天开始，各所小学都同时进入了寒假。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘부터","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘부터","audio":"/audio/ae991bcf586a36f3e1a4.mp3"}},{"text":"초등학교가","meaning":"小学","explanation":"초등학교：小学；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초등학교","audio":"/audio/d8229aa04ee5458ab173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32791","senseId":"1","lemma":"초등학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초등학교가","audio":"/audio/aa46f1d32fc1cf67c198.mp3"}},{"text":"일제히","meaning":"一齐","explanation":"일제히：一齐","readings":[{"term":"일제히","audio":"/audio/dee2c0605b1940e597d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72399","senseId":"1","lemma":"일제히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일제히","audio":"/audio/dee2c0605b1940e597d3.mp3"}},{"text":"겨울","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}},{"text":"방학에","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방학에","audio":"/audio/b1f47686a6bb60d72441.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가서","meaning":"进入，转入","explanation":"들어가다：进入，转入；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"3","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가서","audio":"/audio/f5b92193eb4e9a0d5667.mp3"}},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"d8229aa04ee5458a","term":"초등학교","zh":"小学","audio":"/audio/d8229aa04ee5458ab173.mp3","entryId":"32791","definition":"学校教育的第一阶段，学生满6岁入学，接受6年基本教育的学校。","pronunciation":["초등학꾜"]},{"id":"dee2c0605b1940e5","term":"일제히","zh":"一齐","audio":"/au